(7126115, 1089963, 60173, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition. I have to say though, with the door behind, I get more of a "drunk lady stumbling out of the bathroom" than "vicious".</td>', 'I really like the composition. I have to say though, with the door behind, I get more of a "drunk lady stumbling out of the bathroom" than "vicious".', '2013-11-06 11:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7126124, 1090186, 60173, '<td valign="top">Smash it, smash it!<br/> <br/>Nice lighting. I''m even okay with the shadowing under the eye<strike>s</strike>, because it toughens him up and makes you wonder if he''s got a black eye. Obviously he doesn''t, but for this challenge it works. Ideally, it would have been nice to not have the tiny guitar covering his other eye, but that''s kids for ya. You''ve also got a nice halo to separate him from the background caused by your background light.</td>', 'Smash it, smash it! Nice lighting. I''m even okay with the shadowing under the eyes, because it toughens him up and makes you wonder if he''s got a black eye. Obviously he doesn''t, but for this challenge it works. Ideally, it would have been nice to not have the tiny guitar covering his other eye, but that''s kids for ya. You''ve also got a nice halo to separate him from the background caused by your background light.', '2013-11-06 11:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7126127, 1090248, 60173, '<td valign="top">Something about this doesn''t work. It just doesn''t seem like a "walk on the wild side" to have the music page there. That to me says safe and structured. A wild one would just wing the song, because that''s wild. If that doesn''t make sense, feel free to send me a PM. <br/> <br/>Also, your lighting is really harsh. That does great things to the leather as far as defining highlights and shadows, but the closer you get to the source of the light, the harder it is to look at. Take a look at the upper right corner of the photo. See how nice the lighting is up there? I bet that''s where the light from your source started falling off. But if you look at the bottom left, it''s got really bright spots that jump out at you in an unfriendly way.</td>', 'Something about this doesn''t work. It just doesn''t seem like a "walk on the wild side" to have the music page there. That to me says safe and structured. A wild one would just wing the song, because that''s wild. If that doesn''t make sense, feel free to send me a PM.  Also, your lighting is really harsh. That does great things to the leather as far as defining highlights and shadows, but the closer you get to the source of the light, the harder it is to look at. Take a look at the upper right corner of the photo. See how nice the lighting is up there? I bet that''s where the light from your source started falling off. But if you look at the bottom left, it''s got really bright spots that jump out at you in an unfriendly way.', '2013-11-06 11:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7126128, 1090043, 60173, '<td valign="top">Isn''t that going up? I think you need to reverse the method you used to create this with your flash. I could be wrong though. I haven''t used those flash modes in ages. Really nice idea though.</td>', 'Isn''t that going up? I think you need to reverse the method you used to create this with your flash. I could be wrong though. I haven''t used those flash modes in ages. Really nice idea though.', '2013-11-06 11:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
